<li>While candidates from different educational backgrounds can take up artificial intelligence courses, having knowledge of mathematical concepts such as Calculus can give one a slight edge in understanding the mathematical functioning of the algorithms.</li>
<li>Knowledge of basic Data Science is required – this includes data manipulation and statistical modelling.</li>
</ul>
