<li>Anti Skid braking systems and transmission systems</li>
<li>Control of subway systems and crewless helicopters</li>
<li>Weather forecasting systems</li>
<li>Project risk assessment</li>
<li>Medical diagnosis and treatment plans</li>
<li>Stock marketing prediction and trading</li>
</ul>
