<p>This is derived from a tree having the maximum number of nodes when all levels are fully populated. The total number of nodes can be represented as a geometric series</p>
<p><img src="https://tumfgdyurswklrzsnevv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/uploads/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/image7.png" alt=""></p>
<p>In some conventions where the root height is 0, the formula adjusts to 2 raised to the power of (h+1) minus 1, i.e.,</p>
